# Keep Docker build context small — exclude build artifacts and dev files
**/node_modules
**/build
**/.git
**/coverage
**/__tests__
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
**/vitest*.config*
# Note: src/generated/ is NOT excluded — servers need generated types to build
**/.env
**/.env.*
releases/
reports/
docs/
adr/
scripts/
build-tests/
*.md
!**/package.json
!**/package-lock.json
!**/tsconfig.json
